---
description: Invoke the migration-program-manager skill for an org-wide rollup of mysql-to-postgres-sql migration status across many workspaces.
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user asks for migration status across multiple repos, an org-wide migration rollup, or wants to
see stalled/blocked migrations grouped by squad, read `migration-program-manager/SKILL.md` and follow it.
A single workspace's own migration status routes to `mysql-to-postgres-sql/SKILL.md` instead; a plain
ownership lookup routes to `squad-map/SKILL.md` instead.

Phase index: `migration-program-manager/reference/phase-index.md`. Reference loads:
`migration-program-manager/reference/lazy-load-index.md`.
Read-only — never invokes mysql-to-postgres-sql or squad-map live, only reads their existing output
files. Only writes its own report, rollup JSON, and state file.
